---
layout: base.njk
bodyClass: is-splash
---
{# Splash: three big links in Segmentor. Desktop: one line (Projects left,
   Type centred, About right); phones: stacked, each as wide as the screen.
   They follow the mouse (desktop) or the tilt of the phone (script.js §1)
   and get underlined on hover / tap. Behind them loops the background:
   an animated WebP image (made from bg-desktop.mp4 / bg-mobile.mp4, about
   a sixth of their size, and it never shows a play button). <picture>
   lets the browser take the portrait file when the screen is upright.
   eleventy:ignore keeps the image plugin from turning it into a still. #}
<picture class="splash-bg" aria-hidden="true">
  <source media="(orientation: portrait)" srcset="/media/bg-mobile.webp">
  <img src="/media/bg-desktop.webp" alt="" eleventy:ignore>
</picture>

<nav class="splash-menu" aria-label="Main">
  <ul class="plain-list">
    {% for n in nav %}<li><a class="seg" href="{{ n.url }}">{{ n.label }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</nav>
